{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/290231/", "pk": 290231, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/", "pk": 60827, "shortname": "realfloridaadventures", "name": "Real Florida Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Shingle Creek Guided Kayak Adventure", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "Shingle Creek Guided Kayak Adventure", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 11500, "description": "#Guided Kayak Adventure!\n\n##Duration\n\nApprox. 5 Hours\n\n## About This Tour\n\nThere’s no better way to view Florida’s natural beauty than taking a leisurely kayak tour through one of Central Florida’s best kept secrets…Shingle Creek.  We’ll pick you up and transport you to this hidden gem located just outside the hustle and bustle of the tourist district. \n\nSteeped in rich history, certified guides will lead you down the river pointing out the abundance of wildlife as you glide through ancient cypress forests. This 2 hour out & back eco-tour is a great way to explore the peaceful side of the Sunshine State. Catch glimpses of turtles, birds of prey, wading birds, and maybe even an alligator or two.  Tour includes single kayaks or tandem kayaks, paddling instructions, and all paddling equipment.  \n\nAfter your tour enjoy a picnic lunch along the river before heading back to your pickup location.  This is the perfect half day Florida experience for everyone of all ages to enjoy. \n\nAll tours guides are Certified Kayak Instructors by the American Canoe Association (ACA) as well as First Aid and CPR trained and certified.  Tour duration is approximately 5 hours door to door. \n\n\n\n\n**Included**\n•\t2 hour guided kayak tour with an ACA certified guide\n•\tPicnic lunch by the water\n•\tKayak, paddle, life jacket, and whistle\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney, and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n\n**Not included**\n•\tMeals and Drinks not mentioned\n•\tGratuities\n\n##Pickup Time and Schedule\n\n**Margaritaville Resort Orlando** at 7:15am\n*8000 Fins Up Cir, Kissimmee, FL 34747*\n\n**Golden Corral** at 7:30am\n*8707 Vineland Ave, Orlando, FL 32821*\n  \n**Orlando Starflyer** at 8am \n*8265 International Dr, Orlando, FL 32819*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "We look forward to seeing you soon!\n\n#Shingle Creek Guided Kayak Adventure\n\n**Your exact meeting location shows up above (one of the three) depending on the one you selected.** \n\n**Please complete online waiver in the following link prior to your tour**\nhttps://www.paddlingcenter.com/ecotour-waiver\n\n**Included**\n•\t2 hour guided kayak tour with an ACA certified guide\n•\tPicnic lunch by the water\n•\tKayak, paddle, life jacket, and whistle\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney, and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n\n**Not included**\n•\tMeals and Drinks not mentioned\n•\tGratuities\n\n\n##What to bring\nSunscreen, Sunglasses, Camera’s, Proof of Confirmation", "cancellation